{
  "id": "RS-2026-0009",
  "category": "slopsquat-package",
  "title": "GlassWorm floods Open VSX with 72 extensions impersonating popular developer tools",
  "summary": "Between 31 January and mid-March 2026 the GlassWorm operator published over 72 Open VSX extensions using names built to be mistaken for Prettier, ESLint, Volar, Prisma, Flutter, Python and icon-theme tooling, including two, gvotcha.claude-code-extension and gvotcha.claude-code-extensions, that impersonate Claude Code itself. Delivery moved to transitive dependencies: a clean extension gains installs, then a later update quietly declares a separate GlassWorm-linked extension as a dependency.",
